WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.165 --> 00:00:01.880
(audience applauding)
- So, first of all,

00:00:01.880 --> 00:00:03.300
it's amazing to meet you,

00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:04.920
'cause I'm a big fan.

00:00:04.920 --> 00:00:07.850
Secondly, I know you're here
to talk about something else,

00:00:07.850 --> 00:00:08.740
but we've got to talk

00:00:08.740 --> 00:00:11.170
about Jingle Jangle
because it's very rare,

00:00:11.170 --> 00:00:13.670
I know it's April, I know it's
like not even Christmas time,

00:00:13.670 --> 00:00:16.740
but it's very rare to come
out with a Christmas movie

00:00:16.740 --> 00:00:18.830
that could be a classic.

00:00:18.830 --> 00:00:19.990
And I think like it's a classic.

00:00:19.990 --> 00:00:22.830
My kids loved it. We
watched it so many times.

00:00:22.830 --> 00:00:24.640
Like, have you always been musical?

00:00:24.640 --> 00:00:25.530
- Well, you know, yeah.

00:00:25.530 --> 00:00:27.100
I started in music in the
first place, you know,

00:00:27.100 --> 00:00:28.340
so it was really a great opportunity

00:00:28.340 --> 00:00:30.270
to get a chance to do Jingle Jangle.

00:00:30.270 --> 00:00:32.040
It was actually one of the most fun movies

00:00:32.040 --> 00:00:33.240
I've ever done in my whole career.

00:00:33.240 --> 00:00:35.407
So I had a blast and it an was opportunity

00:00:35.407 --> 00:00:36.510
to get to sing again.

00:00:36.510 --> 00:00:37.343
So that was nice.

00:00:37.343 --> 00:00:39.260
- Oh my God, you kicked ass.

00:00:39.260 --> 00:00:40.840
You were so good.

00:00:40.840 --> 00:00:41.757
All of a sudden I was like,

00:00:41.757 --> 00:00:43.830
"John legend did all the
songs, he's so talented."

00:00:43.830 --> 00:00:45.480
It was so great.

00:00:45.480 --> 00:00:46.770
It was, masterfully done.

00:00:46.770 --> 00:00:48.100
I love the costumes, I love the acting.

00:00:48.100 --> 00:00:48.933
I love the cast.

00:00:48.933 --> 00:00:49.766
It was just so well done.

00:00:49.766 --> 00:00:52.153
I had to start with that
'cause I'm a huge fan.

